Thanks to everyone who replied - the prompt turnaround
on this list is fantastic!

Several people suggested is.element, but that doesn't
seem to be a part of Splus 3.4 for Sparc. The best
solution (because it is a one-liner) came from Jim Pratt:

dayno <- 23:25 
data.m[!is.na(match(data.m$day,dayno)),]

