solution suggested by Sam Buttrey

================
Hi. You can only export things that exist in the database on disk; you can't
export items that are local to a function.

So after you create, call

assign ("ff", ff, immediate=T) and that will create "ff" in your local
database. (Of course it will over-write anything named "ff" that's already
there!)
